# Python cache and build artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments (any depth)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Environment files (any depth)
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Notebook checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS/editor files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode/.history/

# Generated research artifacts (keep docs only)
artifacts/runs/**
!artifacts/runs/README.md

artifacts/metrics/**
!artifacts/metrics/README.md

artifacts/figures/**
!artifacts/figures/README.md

artifacts/reports/**
!artifacts/reports/README.md
